            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Alpine API" class="scroll-mt-20">
                    Alpine API
                </RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    This page uses the <code>rzAccordion</code> parent Alpine <code>x-data</code> component and the <code>accordionItem</code> item-level Alpine component. The item runtime manages toggle state, keeps the existing single or multiple behavior, updates <code>aria-expanded</code>, and handles optional arrow-key focus movement.
                </RzParagraph>
